    {
      "heading": "④ 化成它：分部積分",
      "body": [
        "$u=x$，$dv=\\cot x\\,dx$，$v=\\ln(\\sin x)$：",
        "邊界：$\\frac\\pi2\\ln1=0$；$x\\ln(\\sin x)=x\\ln x+x\\ln\\frac{\\sin x}x\\to0$",
        "這個積分其實不是瑕積分：$x\\cot x\\to1$；分部積分後才出現瑕點，所以要在 $[\\varepsilon,\\frac\\pi2]$ 上做"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}x\\cot x\\,dx",
        "=\\Big[x\\ln(\\sin x)\\Big]_{0^+}^{\\pi/2}-\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln(\\sin x)\\,dx",
        "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}x\\cot x\\,dx=-I=\\frac\\pi2\\ln2\\approx1.0888"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 化成它：換元",
      "body": [
        "令 $x=\\sin\\theta$：$dx=\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$\\sqrt{1-x^2}=\\cos\\theta$",
        "換元在 $[\\varepsilon,1-\\varepsilon]$ 上做；$\\theta\\in(0,\\frac\\pi2)$ 時 $\\cos\\theta>0$，根號不用加絕對值",
        "相關的結果",
        "• $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln(\\cos x)\\,dx=-\\frac\\pi2\\ln2$",
        "• $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi}\\ln(\\sin x)\\,dx=-\\pi\\ln2$",
        "• $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln(\\tan x)\\,dx=0$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx",
        "=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln(\\sin\\theta)\\,d\\theta=-\\frac\\pi2\\ln2"
      ]
    },
